<!--
  Status-bar / notification small icon for audio_service.

  Android requires the small icon for notifications to be a flat,
  monochrome silhouette on a transparent background (the system tints
  it automatically). Using an adaptive launcher icon here causes the
  notification to render blank or to be dropped entirely on several
  OEM skins (MIUI, OneUI, ColorOS), which is why the playback
  notification was never showing up.
-->
